OL,3,AHow do Israel's elections work and who
OL,4,Aare the main contenders?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsrael's general election takes place
OL,7,Fon Tuesday 27 October.
OL,9,FIt's the first election since the 7
OL,10,FOctober 2023 Hamas-led attacks on
OL,11,FIsrael and its subsequent conflicts in
OL,12,FGaza and with Iran, Hezbollah and the
OL,13,FHouthis.
OL,15,FMany view it as one of the most pivotal
OL,16,Felections in Israel's history, with
OL,17,Fglobal implications.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
