OL,3,AHow do Israel's elections work and who
OL,4,Aare the main contenders?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrent polling puts incumbent Benjamin
OL,7,FNetanyahu in a tight race with Gadi
OL,8,FEisenkot, a former head of the Israel
OL,9,FDefense Forces, to become prime
OL,10,Fminister.
